#: ../../source/docs/common-omnibusnanov6.rst:101
#: 08ec939eec9f48d7a27170f41ccf5535
msgid "GPS is attached to UART6"
msgstr "GPS 连接到 UART6"

#: ../../source/docs/common-omnibusnanov6.rst:103
#: 94880ad50cd84d27bca7736b86623f35
msgid "Telem is available at UART 1"
msgstr "数传可用于 UART 1"

#: ../../source/docs/common-omnibusnanov6.rst:105
#: d682edccb39d480fafaf6180936b9e46
msgid ""
"The shared UART3/I2C pins are enabled for I2C operation in default "
":ref:`BRD_ALT_CONFIG <BRD_ALT_CONFIG>` = 0 to allow external compass and / "
"or digital airspeed sensor attachment. Alternatively they can be set to UART"
" operation as SERIAL4 in :ref:`BRD_ALT_CONFIG <BRD_ALT_CONFIG>` = 1."
msgstr ""
"共用的 UART3/I2C 引脚在默认 :ref:`BRD_ALT_CONFIG <BRD_ALT_CONFIG>` = 0 时启用 I2C "
"操作，以允许连接外置罗盘和/或数字空速传感器。或者，也可以在 :ref:`BRD_ALT_CONFIG <BRD_ALT_CONFIG>` = 1 "
"时将其设置为 SERIAL4 的 UART 操作。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-omnibusnanov6.rst:108
#: 28486d8e5d0f4749b5de0769affb06ec
msgid ""
"RC input is via pad marked LED on the board and is compatible all RX serial "
"protocols supported by ArduPilot. The Buzzer output pad has no "
"functionality."
msgstr "RC 输入通过板上标记为 LED 的焊盘接入，兼容 ArduPilot 支持的所有 RC 串行协议。蜂鸣器输出焊盘没有功能。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-omnibusnanov6.rst:112
#: ../../source/docs/common-omnibusnanov6.rst:144
#: b2cea6b230074ec989d4e2401624eda1 ccf7f2f232344301ade9b65ba76a7ec9
msgid "V6.x revision"
msgstr "V6.x 修订版"

#: ../../source/docs/common-omnibusnanov6.rst:116
#: 7e4a91b692704e6ab09a3b0c7e8fc9a8
msgid ""
"This board revision has the fixed inverter moved to USART1 RX pin, so only "
"TX1 pin can be used (output only). 2 full UARTS + I2C is available in "
":ref:`BRD_ALT_CONFIG <BRD_ALT_CONFIG>` = 1, using RX3 / TX3 pins as SERIAL4."
" In default :ref:`BRD_ALT_CONFIG <BRD_ALT_CONFIG>` = 0, RX3 and TX3 pins "
"will default to I2C SDA and SCL respectively. RCInput is on WSL2812 pad. I2C"
" and SERIAL3 for GPS / mag combo is on PPM (=SCL), PB9 (=SDA), RX6 and TX6 "
"pads. Make sure to leave solder jumpers for inverter setup disconnected."
msgstr ""
"此板修订版将固定反相器移至 USART1 RX 引脚，因此只能使用 TX1 引脚（仅输出）。在 :ref:`BRD_ALT_CONFIG "
"<BRD_ALT_CONFIG>` = 1 时，使用 RX3/TX3 引脚作为 SERIAL4，可获得 2 个全双工 UART + I2C。在默认 "
":ref:`BRD_ALT_CONFIG <BRD_ALT_CONFIG>` = 0 时，RX3 和 TX3 引脚分别默认为 I2C SDA 和 "
"SCL。RC 输入在 WSL2812 焊盘上。GPS/磁力计组合的 I2C 和 SERIAL3 在 PPM（=SCL）、PB9（=SDA）、RX6 和 "
"TX6 焊盘上。确保保留反相器设置的焊接跳线为断开状态。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-omnibusnanov6.rst:124
#: f3b02d076492468db43a77dd682158eb
msgid "Battery monitoring"
msgstr "电池监控"

#: ../../source/docs/common-omnibusnanov6.rst:127
#: b3b99462dbcf4f41a79a0bdc51ba3f72
msgid "Original V6 revision"
msgstr "原版 V6 修订版"

#: ../../source/docs/common-omnibusnanov6.rst:129
#: a161e242d2cb4c2381ef83cbf7eceac1
msgid "Original V6 revision supports analog voltage monitoring on VBAT pin."
msgstr "原版 V6 修订版支持在 VBAT 引脚上进行模拟电压监控。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-omnibusnanov6.rst:131
#: c3546058a0cd4d1e8b2a6ec653737b37
msgid ""
"Set :ref:`BATT_MONITOR <BATT_MONITOR>` to 3 (= analog voltage only) and "
"reboot."
msgstr "将 :ref:`BATT_MONITOR <BATT_MONITOR>` 设置为 3（=仅模拟电压）并重启。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-omnibusnanov6.rst:134
#: b3fdcf134e184fc5af1fb6e76f65c183
msgid "Default pin values:"
msgstr "默认引脚值："

#: ../../source/docs/common-omnibusnanov6.rst:136
#: 5278ff29f3104e418f9dc0b5ea4b8423
msgid ":ref:`BATT_VOLT_PIN<BATT_VOLT_PIN__AP_BattMonitor_Analog>` = 12"
msgstr ":ref:`BATT_VOLT_PIN<BATT_VOLT_PIN__AP_BattMonitor_Analog>` = 12"

#: ../../source/docs/common-omnibusnanov6.rst:138
#: 749e503422dc4b20a19cd97f5e87bddb
msgid ":ref:`BATT_VOLT_MULT<BATT_VOLT_MULT__AP_BattMonitor_Analog>` = 11"
msgstr ":ref:`BATT_VOLT_MULT<BATT_VOLT_MULT__AP_BattMonitor_Analog>` = 11"

#: ../../source/docs/common-omnibusnanov6.rst:140
#: 22faeb952d78476bbc40f273b12ed585
msgid ""
"Optionally add voltage and / or current monitoring using ESC telemetry "
"capable ESCs. See instructions :ref:`here <blheli32-esc-telemetry>`."
msgstr ""
"可选择使用支持 ESC 数传的 ESC 添加电压和/或电流监控。参见 :ref:`此处 <blheli32-esc-telemetry>` 的说明。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-omnibusnanov6.rst:146
#: 123b1613f48646c5a061055d7006738f
msgid ""
"V6.x revision has an additional ADC available for external current sensor "
"hardware / PDB connection in 4in1 socket / respective pads."
msgstr "V6.x 修订版在 4in1 插座/相应焊盘上有额外的 ADC，可用于外部电流传感器硬件/电源分配板连接。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-omnibusnanov6.rst:148
#: b34c8e1467ea40739d90deded647312a
msgid ":ref:`BATT_CURR_PIN<BATT_CURR_PIN__AP_BattMonitor_Analog>` = 11"
msgstr ":ref:`BATT_CURR_PIN<BATT_CURR_PIN__AP_BattMonitor_Analog>` = 11"

#: ../../source/docs/common-omnibusnanov6.rst:150
#: 40786dfca81c414c9fe73cb333119b23
msgid ":ref:`BATT_AMP_PERVLT<BATT_AMP_PERVLT__AP_BattMonitor_Analog>` = 18.2"
msgstr ":ref:`BATT_AMP_PERVLT<BATT_AMP_PERVLT__AP_BattMonitor_Analog>` = 18.2"

#: ../../source/docs/common-omnibusnanov6.rst:152
#: f4ffb65c1e804430b9ecbc3dd6e82ca0
msgid ""
"Set :ref:`BATT_MONITOR <BATT_MONITOR>` to 4 (= analog voltage and current) "
"and reboot for full battery monitoring support."
msgstr "将 :ref:`BATT_MONITOR <BATT_MONITOR>` 设置为 4（=模拟电压和电流）并重启以获得完整的电池监控支持。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-omnibusnanov6.rst:156
#: c9d8e0917fee4492a04c0736c3e1f7c1
msgid ""
"Current pin defaults to pin 11 in ardupilot runtime. Alternatively, it can "
"be used for analog RSSI input or connecting an analog airspeed sensor. "
"Adjust :ref:`BATT_AMP_PERVLT<BATT_AMP_PERVLT__AP_BattMonitor_Analog>` "
"default of 18.2 as required by the individual current sensor hardware used."
msgstr ""
"在 ArduPilot 运行时，电流引脚默认为引脚 11。或者，它也可以用于模拟 RSSI "
"输入或连接模拟空速传感器。根据所使用的具体电流传感器硬件，按需调整 "
":ref:`BATT_AMP_PERVLT<BATT_AMP_PERVLT__AP_BattMonitor_Analog>` 的默认值 18.2。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-omnibusnanov6.rst:160
#: 8cf11b638f8448dca6049b9d8644c41d
msgid "Flashing Firmware"
msgstr "刷写固件"

#: ../../source/docs/common-omnibusnanov6.rst:161
#: 29f1d55d8eba4a58b5eec1ffbb41c1c6
msgid ""
"Usually these boards are sold pre-flashed with Betaflight / iNav firmwares. "
"In order to use ArduPilot, first time flashing requires both the bootloader "
"and the firmware to be updated. Subsequent ArduPilot firmware updates do not"
" require updating the bootloader again."
msgstr ""
"这些板通常出厂时预装了 Betaflight/iNav 固件。要使用 ArduPilot，首次刷写需要同时更新引导程序和固件。后续 ArduPilot "
"固件更新不再需要重新更新引导程序。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-omnibusnanov6.rst:164
#: 1525b5ea3d1d49218be604d61a5b3e7d
msgid "First time flashing"
msgstr "首次刷写"

#: ../../source/docs/common-omnibusnanov6.rst:166
#: c7a730959b6848ceb84bba3ad3faa416
msgid ""
"Follow the instructions `here <https://ardupilot.org/plane/docs/common-"
"loading-firmware-onto-chibios-only-boards.html>`__ using the "
"\"arduXXX_with_bl.hex\" file for the \"OmnibusNanoV6\" target."
msgstr ""
"按照 `此处 <https://ardupilot.org/plane/docs/common-loading-firmware-onto-"
"chibios-only-boards.html>`__ "
"的说明，使用「OmnibusNanoV6」目标的「arduXXX_with_bl.hex」文件。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-omnibusnanov6.rst:168
#: 97836828fa1143abaef86d81840e3995
msgid ""
"When instructed to enter DFU mode, locate the DFU button / jumper pads and "
"keep the button pressed / jumper pads shorted while connecting the board to "
"your computer via USB. If done successfully, the red power LED should light "
"solid while the blue activity LED should not light at all."
msgstr ""
"当提示进入 DFU 模式时，找到 DFU 按钮/跳线焊盘，在通过 USB 将板子连接到计算机时按住按钮/短接焊盘。如果操作成功，红色电源 LED "
"应常亮，而蓝色活动 LED 应完全不亮。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-omnibusnanov6.rst:174
#: 474e23580e1b4503819dbe82a2b5278d
msgid "Subsequent firmware updates"
msgstr "后续固件更新"

#: ../../source/docs/common-omnibusnanov6.rst:176
#: 8e8023da9d1f4e9f85f7cdc4167c545d
msgid ""
"Follow the instructions `here <https://ardupilot.org/plane/docs/common-"
"loading-firmware-onto-pixhawk.html>`__ but choose \"Load Custom Firmware\" "
"and browse to the respective \"arduXXX.apj\" file for the \"OmnibusNanoV6\" "
"target, or your own .apj file if building your own firmware."
msgstr ""
"按照 `此处 <https://ardupilot.org/plane/docs/common-loading-firmware-onto-"
"pixhawk.html>`__ "
"的说明，但选择「加载自定义固件」并浏览到「OmnibusNanoV6」目标对应的「arduXXX.apj」文件，或者如果您自己编译固件，则选择您自己的 "
".apj 文件。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-omnibusnanov6.rst:183
#: d1947a61a13f4c69b76eadf9dfc8fceb
msgid "Compile ArduPilot"
